[00:00.601]Did you know that the world
[00:10.089]Is comin' to the end?
[00:19.811]And did you hear the screams
[00:28.657]Of all the mothers forced to pretend?
[00:33.125]
[00:39.993]I carried my girl across the desert
[00:48.392]Yet not one person noticed her dead
[00:59.838]I carried my girl to the ocean
[01:08.330]Yet not one person lifted their head
[01:18.384]
[01:19.811]All our babies
[01:24.901]They're all our babies
[01:30.058]
[01:50.109]And are you moved by all these tears
[01:59.275]That have swept away the dead?
